    "content": "Our team\nThe People Behind\nWe3vision\nDevelopers, designers, artists and marketers, working together in one office in Surat. Scroll to walk through the office and point at anybody to meet them.\nWalk through the office\nWork with us\nWhy the team matters\nBehind\nevery\nscreen,\nthere\nis\na\nperson\nA website, an app or a virtual world looks like technology. It is really a long list of small decisions, made by people who care.\nThe way a button feels, the way a page loads, the way a 3D model moves:\nsomebody thought about every one of them.\nAt We3vision that somebody sits in our office in Surat. They are developers, designers, 3D artists, engineers and marketers, and they have been building together since 2019. We do not hide them behind a company name. This page is here to introduce them.\nTools change every year. What does not change is that good work comes from people who listen, disagree kindly, help each other and finish what they start. That is why the team comes first at We3vision, and the projects come after.\nWe move forward because they move forward. Every project we ship is a thank-you to the people who built it.\nThe We3vision way\nVP\nHR\nPP\nVM\nHC\nKN\nRV\nTM\nTM\nKR\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nTM\nVinod Patel\nCFO & Director\nHarsh Ramoliya\nMD\nParth Patel\nCHRO & Director\nManagers\nMetaverse\n·\n2\nDesign\n·\n4\nWeb & Mobile\n·\n5\nAI & CRM\n·\n12\nMarketing\n·\n3\nThe",
